sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CF as Connection Fiber<br/>连接线程 T0
    participant TX as Transaction
    participant Q as EngineShard::queue_
    participant SF as Shard queue Fiber<br/>目标线程 T1
    participant ES as EngineShard / PollExecution
    participant CB as GET/SET shard callback
    participant RB as ReplyBuilder

    CF->>CF: Service::DispatchCommand<br/>CommandId::Invoke -> CmdGet/CmdSet
    CF->>TX: co_await SingleHop(callback)
    TX->>TX: ScheduleSingleHop -> Execute -> ScheduleInternal

    alt CanRunInlined() == true
        TX->>ES: ScheduleInShard(EngineShard::tlocal(), true)
        ES->>CB: immediate_run -> RunCallback() -> callback(tx, shard)
        CB-->>ES: OpStatus / OpResult
        ES-->>TX: ScheduleInternal 直接 barrier.Dec()
        TX->>ES: PollExecutionIfDeferred()
        TX->>TX: DispatchHop 看到 run_cnt == 0
        TX-->>CF: 从 SingleHop 返回
    else 不能 inline：先投递 schedule callback
        TX->>Q: shard_set->Add(target_shard, schedule_cb)
        Note over CF,TX: Connection Fiber 在 schedule barrier.Wait() 挂起<br/>OS 线程 T0 可运行其他 Fiber
        Q->>SF: FiberQueue::Run()
        SF->>ES: schedule_cb -> ScheduleInShard(..., true)

        alt schedule 阶段可以 optimistic immediate_run
            ES->>CB: RunCallback() -> callback(tx, shard)
            CB-->>ES: OpStatus / OpResult
            ES-->>TX: FinishHop -> schedule barrier.Dec()
            TX->>TX: DispatchHop 看到 run_cnt == 0<br/>不再调用 PollExecution
        else 插入 TxQueue，需要 execution hop
            ES-->>TX: FinishHop -> schedule barrier.Dec()
            TX->>TX: DispatchHop 标记 is_armed
            TX->>Q: shard_set->Add(target_shard, poll_cb)
            Note over CF,TX: Connection Fiber 在 execution barrier.Wait() 再次挂起
            Q->>SF: FiberQueue::Run()
            SF->>ES: poll_cb -> PollExecution("exec_cb")
            ES->>ES: PollExecutionInternal()
            ES->>CB: RunInShard() -> RunCallback() -> callback(tx, shard)
            CB-->>ES: OpStatus / OpResult
            ES-->>TX: FinishHop -> execution barrier.Dec()
        end
        TX-->>CF: barrier 归零，Connection Fiber 恢复
    end

    CF->>CF: CmdGet/CmdSet 从 co_await 后继续
    CF->>RB: GetReplies::Send() / SendOk()
    RB-->>CF: 写入连接回复缓冲
